codex
Three candidate rules match all 32 labels: a fixed logit penalty, a suppression region, and a penalty that varies with the number of users affected. Each candidate also includes the same small EU adjustment to account for the other label differences. I will state that assumption in CANDIDATES.md and use the queries to test where the rules give different labels.
